import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 610 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Acceleration-Domain Law-Anchoring Engineering","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 610 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Acceleration-Domain Law-Anchoring Engineering","no":610,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Law Anchoring","Isolated Space","Technical Implementation","Boundary Engineering"],"related":["13-Spatial Jurisprudence Scheduling System Details","64-Isolated-Space Construction Technology","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0610_模块3-时间域技术实现-加速域法则锚定工程.md","filePath":"en/0610_模块3-时间域技术实现-加速域法则锚定工程.md"}'),o={name:"en/0610_模块3-时间域技术实现-加速域法则锚定工程.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,d,h){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-610-time-domain-technical-implementation-acceleration-domain-law-anchoring-engineering" tabindex="-1">Entry 610 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Acceleration-Domain Law-Anchoring Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-610-time-domain-technical-implementation-acceleration-domain-law-anchoring-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 610 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Acceleration-Domain Law-Anchoring Engineering&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 13, 64, 27 | Series: Time-Domain Technical Implementation (Entry 2)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-how-is-the-wall-of-100×-flow-built" tabindex="-1">Introduction: how is the wall of 100× flow built <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-how-is-the-wall-of-100×-flow-built" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: how is the wall of 100× flow built&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Once the Origin Acceleration Domain opens flow to 100×, one year inside, one day outside. This raises a fatal engineering question: <strong>why doesn&#39;t the wall between this year and this day collapse?</strong> Will someone rushing out from inside sweep outside causality along? Will outside natural disasters instantly flood into the 100×-flow domain? The answer is &quot;law-anchoring engineering&quot; — a time interface built out of the law network. This entry tells how this wall is built, tested, repaired.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through the engineering: anti-predation axiom requires this wall only isolate causal risk, not knowledge feedback; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires wall space open by contribution, not privately occupied by the strong; collective ascension axiom requires wall maintenance shared by the whole network; causal self-discipline axiom requires the wall &quot;isolate pollution,&quot; not &quot;cut off contact&quot;; law-first axiom requires wall thickness, leakage rate, lifespan all have law-level definitions, not by feel. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-layer-wall-of-law-anchoring" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Layer Wall of Law Anchoring <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-layer-wall-of-law-anchoring" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Layer Wall of Law Anchoring&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s boundary is not one membrane, but three nested walls:</p><ol><li><strong>Spatial-jurisprudence wall</strong>: based on the spatial jurisprudence scheduling system (Document 13) and isolated-space construction technology (Document 64), physically separating the acceleration domain from the real plane. Outermost, responsible for &quot;matter&quot; isolation.</li><li><strong>Time-flow wall</strong>: inside the spatial wall, calibrate subjective/objective time multipliers, lock the inside-outside time interface. Middle layer, responsible for &quot;time&quot; isolation.</li><li><strong>Causal-filter wall</strong>: innermost, only letting abstract knowledge pass (Document 87), intercepting concrete causal disturbances. Most critical layer, responsible for &quot;fruit&quot; filtering.</li></ol><p>Three walls layer by layer: matter not mixed, time not cross, fruit not disturbed.</p><h2 id="ii-anchor-node-deployment-and-calibration" tabindex="-1">II. Anchor-Node Deployment and Calibration <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-anchor-node-deployment-and-calibration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Anchor-Node Deployment and Calibration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law anchoring is not just drawing a circle, but jointly maintained by several &quot;anchor nodes.&quot; Engineering points:</p><ul><li><strong>Node distribution</strong>: anchor nodes uniformly deployed along the acceleration-domain boundary, spacing optimized by law-network simulation, eliminating boundary weak points.</li><li><strong>Resonance calibration</strong>: each node must maintain resonance sync with the law network; deviation over threshold triggers calibration (Document 27). This is why the Anchor Supervisory Committee periodically inspects — once anchoring drifts, 100× flow may &quot;leak&quot; a corner on some side.</li><li><strong>Redundancy design</strong>: key nodes equipped with backup nodes; single-point failure does not collapse the whole wall. This is engineering reliability&#39;s bottom line.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-leakage-rate-an-engineering-indicator-that-must-be-public" tabindex="-1">III. Leakage Rate: An Engineering Indicator That Must Be Public <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-leakage-rate-an-engineering-indicator-that-must-be-public" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Leakage Rate: An Engineering Indicator That Must Be Public&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchoring engineering has an honest indicator — <strong>leakage rate</strong>, i.e., the proportion of outside causality seeping inside, or inside causality leaking outside. The engineering goal is not zero leakage (legally uneconomical), but pressing leakage within causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s acceptable threshold, and making this threshold public:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Leakage Direction</th><th>Allowable Threshold</th><th>Consequence of Overrun</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Outside→Inside (disaster seepage)</td><td>&lt;0.1%</td><td>Domain-internal R&amp;D disturbed, isolation reinforcement started</td></tr><tr><td>Inside→Outside (causal leakage)</td><td>&lt;0.01%</td><td>Immediately slow down, Alaya retrospective tracing</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge feedback (expected pass)</td><td>100% abstracted</td><td>Not intercepted, only desensitized</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Writing leakage rate into engineering indicators is law-first axiom&#39;s expression: <strong>not &quot;should be fine,&quot; but measurable, publishable numbers</strong>.</p><h2 id="iv-technical-interface-with-only-knowledge-returned" tabindex="-1">IV. Technical Interface with &quot;Only-Knowledge-Returned&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-technical-interface-with-only-knowledge-returned" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Technical Interface with &quot;Only-Knowledge-Returned&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The causal-filter wall&#39;s core technology is engineeringizing Document 87&#39;s &quot;only-knowledge-returned principle.&quot; Everything produced inside the acceleration domain — techniques, data, emotional impact — is &quot;desensitized&quot; when crossing the causal-filter wall: concrete people, events, causal traces stripped, only abstract knowledge and patterns retained. Technically, this is done through the Alaya Network&#39;s semantic layering interface: knowledge layer passes, causal layer intercepts, emotional layer converted into safely digestible teaching cases. If this interface is poorly designed, the acceleration domain degenerates into another &quot;Main God Space&quot; (Entry 607).</p><h2 id="supplementary-argument-the-philosophy-of-boundary-engineering-—-isolation-closure" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Argument: The Philosophy of Boundary Engineering — Isolation ≠ Closure <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-argument-the-philosophy-of-boundary-engineering-—-isolation-closure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Argument: The Philosophy of Boundary Engineering — Isolation ≠ Closure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchoring engineering is often misunderstood as &quot;sealing the acceleration domain into an iron bucket.&quot; This is a misunderstanding. The three walls&#39; purpose is not cutting inside-outside contact, but precisely controlling what may pass and what may not. Matter not mixed, time not cross, causality not disturbed — but knowledge may pass, experience may pass, distress signals may pass. A truly good isolation wall is not an airtight wall, but a wall that selectively breathes — it blocks pollution, lets value through. This &quot;controlled permeability&quot; is precisely the spatial jurisprudence scheduling system&#39;s (Document 13) essence: isolation is for safer opening, not for turning the acceleration domain into another privately hidden secret realm. Boundary&#39;s art lies in letting &quot;fast&quot; and &quot;real&quot; neither collide nor be separated.</p><h2 id="brief-transition" tabindex="-1">Brief Transition <a class="header-anchor" href="#brief-transition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Brief Transition&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It is worth adding that law-anchoring engineering not only guards the Origin Acceleration Domain, the Quest Sediment Domain also needs its slow isolation wall — both share the same set of anchor nodes and leakage-rate standards, only knob direction reversed. The fast and slow domains, one wall, same source.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: three walls configured by risk tier, not wasting top-tier anchoring in low-risk areas</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: causal-filter wall ensures domain-internal R&amp;D results flow back as knowledge, not fenced into private retention</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s acceleration zone glosses over with &quot;secret realm barriers&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s boundary has leakage-rate indicators to check</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: wall specs adapt to different lineages — consciousness-information race&#39;s wall leans causal filtration, carbon-based race&#39;s leans physical isolation</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: anchoring parameters, leakage thresholds, calibration procedures all public; new planes may self-build acceleration domains by the same engineering standard</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>100× flow is safe not because protagonist halo shields it, but because a measurable, calibratable, repairable law wall steadily catches it. The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s true technical content is not &quot;fast&quot; itself, but &quot;after going fast, not causing trouble.&quot; Law-anchoring engineering is the safety net that lets civilization dare to speed up.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial Jurisprudence Scheduling System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/64-隔离空间构建技术.html">Entry 64 · Isolated-Space Construction Technology</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/87-仅回传知识原则.html">Entry 87 · Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle</a> · <a href="./609_模块3-时间域技术实现总论-法则网络时间流速调控.html">Entry 609 · Time-Flow-Rate Control Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
